sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User as Authorized User
    participant UI as Web Portal / Mobile App
    participant API as OrdersController
    participant Service as OrderService
    participant Store as OrderStore
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. VIEW ORDER LIST AND HISTORY
    %% ==========================================

    User->>+UI: Open Order History

    UI->>+API: List(filters)
    API->>+Service: ListAsync(query)

    Note over Service,Store: Apply role-based order visibility

    Service->>+Store: ListAsync(query, actorScope)
    Store->>+DB: SELECT orders by status, date and authorized scope
    DB-->>Store: Matching order records
    deactivate DB

    Store-->>Service: Order list
    deactivate Store

    Service-->>API: PagedOrderResult
    deactivate Service

    API-->>UI: Order list response
    deactivate API

    UI-->>User: Display orders and current statuses
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. VIEW ORDER DETAILS
    %% ==========================================

    opt User selects an order

        User->>+UI: Select order to view details

        UI->>+API: Get(orderId)
        API->>+Service: GetAsync(orderId)

        Service->>+Store: FindAsync(orderId)
        Store->>+DB: SELECT order, lines, prices and fulfillment details
        DB-->>Store: Order data or null
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: OrderView or null
        deactivate Store

        alt Order exists

            Service->>+Store: CanViewAsync(orderId, actor)
            Store->>+DB: SELECT order ownership and access scope
            DB-->>Store: Authorization result
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Access allowed or denied
            deactivate Store

            alt User is authorized

                Note right of Service: Include allocation, quotation,<br/>payment and delivery progress

                Service-->>API: OrderDetailResult

            else Order outside authorized scope

                Service-->>API: 403 Forbidden

            end

        else Order not found

            Service-->>API: 404 Not Found

        end

        deactivate Service

        API-->>UI: Order details or error
        deactivate API

        UI-->>User: Display order details or error
        deactivate UI

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 3. VIEW ORDER STATUS TIMELINE
    %% ==========================================

    opt User opens timeline for an accessible order

        User->>+UI: View Order Status Timeline

        UI->>+API: Timeline(orderId)
        API->>+Service: GetTimelineAsync(orderId)

        Service->>+Store: FindAsync(orderId)
        Store->>+DB: SELECT order and related status history
        DB-->>Store: Order and timeline records
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: OrderView or null
        deactivate Store

        alt Order exists

            Service->>+Store: CanViewAsync(orderId, actor)
            Store->>+DB: SELECT user access to requested order
            DB-->>Store: Authorization result
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Access allowed or denied
            deactivate Store

            alt User is authorized

                Note over Service,Store: Build timeline from recorded status,<br/>allocation, shipment and receipt data

                Service-->>API: OrderTimelineResult

            else Access denied

                Service-->>API: 403 Forbidden

            end

        else Order not found

            Service-->>API: 404 Not Found

        end

        deactivate Service

        API-->>UI: Timeline result or error
        deactivate API

        UI-->>User: Display chronological order history
        deactivate UI

    end

    Note over User,DB: Order status, delivery progress and financial completion are displayed separately